{"id":"nave:eliab","source":"nave","name":"Eliab","slug":"eliab","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"1. A Reubenite, progenitor of Dathan and Abiram Nu 26:8,9; 16:1,12; De 11:6","refs":[["Num",26,8,26,8],["Num",26,9,26,9],["Num",16,1,16,1],["Num",16,12,16,12],["Deut",11,6,11,6]]},{"text":"2. Son of Helon Nu 1:9; 2:7; 7:24,29; 10:16","refs":[["Num",1,9,1,9],["Num",2,7,2,7],["Num",7,24,7,24],["Num",7,29,7,29],["Num",10,16,10,16]]},{"text":"3. Ancestor of Samuel 1Ch 6:27","refs":[["1Chr",6,27,6,27]]},{"text":"Also called ELIHU 1Sa 1:1","refs":[["1Sam",1,1,1,1]]},{"text":"And ELIEL 1Ch 6:34","refs":[["1Chr",6,34,6,34]]},{"text":"4. Son of Jesse and eldest brother of David 1Sa 16:6; 17:13,28; 1Ch 2:13","refs":[["1Sam",16,6,16,6],["1Sam",17,13,17,13],["1Sam",17,28,17,28],["1Chr",2,13,2,13]]},{"text":"A prince in the tribe of Judah 1Ch 27:18","refs":[["1Chr",27,18,27,18]]},{"text":"5. A hero of the tribe of Gad 1Ch 12:9","refs":[["1Chr",12,9,12,9]]},{"text":"6. A Levite, a porter and musician 1Ch 15:18,20; 16:5","refs":[["1Chr",15,18,15,18],["1Chr",15,20,15,20],["1Chr",16,5,16,5]]}],"refCount":22}
